local Qwen3.5-27B inference, text and vision, in one file.

downloads a pinned llama.cpp release and the unsloth
Q5_K_XL GGUF on first use, runs llama-server on a free
port, talks to it over the OpenAI chat api. fits a 24 GB
card with 64k context.

    $ uv add git+https://github.com/sueszli/quick-qwen27b

    from qwen import Qwen

    with Qwen() as llm:
        r = llm.chat("why is the sky blue?")
        r = llm.chat("what is this?", images="photo.png")
        r = llm.chat(images="photo.png", think=False)
        print(r.reasoning, r.content, r.usage)

    $ QWEN_WEIGHTS_DIR=/somewhere uv run example.py

references:

- https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-27B-GGUF
- https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
